    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. Could you go into a bit more detail on the maintenance for the natural stone? Like, if we go with something like marble, what are the actual day-to-day upkeep requirements to make sure it doesn't look worn out or damaged after a year of heavy use? Also, any specific types of stone you'd recommend for durability?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
