      "content": "To maintain marble or pure natural stone in a high-traffic lobby, you must use pH-neutral cleaners daily and avoid acidic mops, as even routine spills can permanently etch the surface. Committee appointments like Static Sealants and hourly re-polishing every two years also help mitigate scratches and wear. Higher耐磨 compounds like granite or slate are generally a better choice than marble because they resist staining and etching far better.",
