      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. One thing though, the client is worried about \"hidden\" damage. Like, can certain types of floor wear happen that aren't immediately obvious, or that seem to happen almost \"mysteriously\" overnight? For example, small nicks or weird dull spots that don't seem to correspond to any particular heavy object being dropped? How would we prevent that kind of unpredictable wear and tear?",
